    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2\"><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">1</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">Omvandla samtliga areor till kvadratmeter.</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[34\\ \\mathrm{dm^2}=0{,}34\\ \\mathrm{m^2}\\]\\[0{,}45\\ \\mathrm{m^2}=0{,}45\\ \\mathrm{m^2}\\]\\[3200\\ \\mathrm{mm^2}=0{,}0032\\ \\mathrm{m^2}\\]\\[4150\\ \\mathrm{cm^2}=0{,}415\\ \\mathrm{m^2}\\]</div></div></div><p class=\"facit-svar\"><strong>Svar:</strong> \\(0{,}45\\ \\mathrm{m^2}&gt;4150\\ \\mathrm{cm^2}&gt;34\\ \\mathrm{dm^2}&gt;3200\\ \\mathrm{mm^2}\\).</p></div>",
