    "id": "3.14",
    "kap": 3,
    "omr": "diagram",
    "niva": "E",
    "poang": "(2/1/0)",
    "t": "<p>En vagn står stilla vid t = 0. Sedan har den den konstanta accelerationen 3,0 m/s² i 4,0 sekunder.</p>\n<ol><li>Rita ett a-t-diagram.</li><li>Vilken fart har vagnen efter 4,0 s?</li>\n<li>Hur långt har den kommit?</li></ol>",
    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2\"><span class=\"fig\"><svg height=\"306\" width=\"500\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 245\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Acceleration-tid-diagram med konstant acceleration 3 meter per sekundkvadrat.\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><line x1=\"48\" y1=\"67.5\" x2=\"372\" y2=\"67.5\" stroke=\"#E4E3E6\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"48\" y1=\"115\" x2=\"372\" y2=\"115\" stroke=\"#E4E3E6\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"48\" y1=\"162.5\" x2=\"372\" y2=\"162.5\" stroke=\"#E4E3E6\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"129\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"129\" y2=\"210\" stroke=\"#E4E3E6\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"210\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"210\" y2=\"210\" stroke=\"#E4E3E6\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"291\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"291\" y2=\"210\" stroke=\"#E4E3E6\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"48\" y1=\"210\" x2=\"372\" y2=\"210\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"48\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"48\" y2=\"210\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><polyline points=\"48.0,20.0 372.0,20.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2A5D9E\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><g font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#5C575E\"><text x=\"338\" y=\"235\" text-anchor=\"end\">t / s</text><text x=\"13\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" transform=\"rotate(-90 13 115)\">a / (m/s²)</text><text x=\"48\" y=\"227\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0</text><text x=\"372\" y=\"227\" text-anchor=\"middle\">4</text><text x=\"40\" y=\"24.0\" text-anchor=\"end\">3</text></g></svg></span><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">a</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">Konstant acceleration visas som en vågrät linje på nivån 3,0 m/s².</p></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">b</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">Arean under acceleration–tid-kurvan är hastighetsändringen.</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[v=0+3{,}0\\cdot4{,}0=12\\ \\mathrm{m/s}\\]</div></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">c</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">Vagnen startar från vila.</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[s=\\frac{3{,}0\\cdot4{,}0^2}{2}=24\\ \\mathrm m\\]</div></div></div><p class=\"facit-svar\"><strong>Svar:</strong> Efter 4,0 s är farten \\(12\\ \\mathrm{m/s}\\), och vagnen har färdats \\(24\\ \\mathrm m\\).</p></div>",
