    "niva": "E",
    "poang": "(2/1/0)",
    "t": "<p>Under en provkörning mäts en bils fart.</p>\n<table class=\"data\"><tr><th>t (s)</th><th>v (m/s)</th></tr>\n<tr><td>0</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>4</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>8</td></tr>\n<tr><td>6</td><td>12</td></tr><tr><td>8</td><td>16</td></tr></table>\n<ol><li>Rita ett v-t-diagram.</li><li>Bestäm accelerationen ur diagrammets lutning.</li>\n<li>Bestäm sträckan ur arean under kurvan.</li></ol>",
    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2\"><span class=\"fig\"><svg height=\"306\" width=\"500\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 245\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Rät fart-tid-graf från noll till 16 meter per sekund på åtta sekunder.\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><line x1=\"48\" y1=\"67.5\" x2=\"372\" y2=\"67.5\" stroke=\"#E4E3E6\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"48\" y1=\"115\" x2=\"372\" y2=\"115\" stroke=\"#E4E3E6\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"48\" y1=\"162.5\" x2=\"372\" y2=\"162.5\" stroke=\"#E4E3E6\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"129\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"129\" y2=\"210\" stroke=\"#E4E3E6\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"210\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"210\" y2=\"210\" stroke=\"#E4E3E6\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"291\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"291\" y2=\"210\" stroke=\"#E4E3E6\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"48\" y1=\"210\" x2=\"372\" y2=\"210\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"48\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"48\" y2=\"210\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><polyline points=\"48.0,210.0 129.0,162.5 210.0,115.0 291.0,67.5 372.0,20.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2A5D9E\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><g font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#5C575E\"><text x=\"338\" y=\"235\" text-anchor=\"end\">t / s</text><text x=\"13\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" transform=\"rotate(-90 13 115)\">v / (m/s)</text><text x=\"48\" y=\"227\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0</text><text x=\"372\" y=\"227\" text-anchor=\"middle\">8</text><text x=\"40\" y=\"24.0\" text-anchor=\"end\">16</text></g></svg></span><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">a</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">Mätpunkterna ligger på en rät linje genom origo.</p><p>Det visar att farten ökar lika mycket under lika långa tidsintervall.</p></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">b</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">Accelerationen är linjens lutning.</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[a=\\frac{\\Delta v}{\\Delta t}=\\frac{16-0}{8-0}=2{,}0\\ \\mathrm{m/s^2}\\]</div></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">c</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">Sträckan är triangelarean under fartkurvan.</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[s=\\frac{8\\cdot16}{2}=64\\ \\mathrm m\\]</div></div></div><p class=\"facit-svar\"><strong>Svar:</strong> Accelerationen är \\(2{,}0\\ \\mathrm{m/s^2}\\), och bilen färdas \\(64\\ \\mathrm m\\).</p></div>",
