        "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2\"><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">b</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">Lägg till balkongens höjd.</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[h_{\\max}=4{,}0+6{,}16=10{,}16\\ \\mathrm m\\]</div></div></div></div>",
