        "t": "<p>En boll kastas rakt uppåt med farten 11 m/s från en balkong 4,0 m över marken.</p><span class=\"fig\"><svg height=\"279\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" viewbox=\"0.000 34.448 330.000 184.036\" width=\"500\"><rect fill=\"#E8DCC6\" height=\"90\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\" width=\"120\" x=\"70\" y=\"110\"></rect><rect fill=\"#fff\" height=\"26\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" width=\"34\" x=\"90\" y=\"140\"></rect><rect fill=\"#fff\" height=\"26\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" width=\"34\" x=\"140\" y=\"140\"></rect><rect fill=\"#E8DCC6\" height=\"8\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\" width=\"140\" x=\"60\" y=\"102\"></rect><line stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-linecap=\"square\" stroke-width=\"2\" x1=\"64\" x2=\"64\" y1=\"102\" y2=\"86\"></line><line stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-linecap=\"square\" stroke-width=\"2\" x1=\"196\" x2=\"196\" y1=\"102\" y2=\"86\"></line><line stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-linecap=\"square\" stroke-width=\"2\" x1=\"64\" x2=\"196\" y1=\"86\" y2=\"86\"></line><rect fill=\"#E8DCC6\" height=\"9\" width=\"310\" x=\"10\" y=\"200\"></rect><line stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-linecap=\"square\" stroke-width=\"2\" x1=\"10\" x2=\"320\" y1=\"200\" y2=\"200\"></line><circle cx=\"240\" cy=\"72\" fill=\"#fff\" r=\"11\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"></circle><line stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-linecap=\"square\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" x1=\"272\" x2=\"272\" y1=\"110\" y2=\"200\"></line><line stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-linecap=\"square\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" x1=\"267\" x2=\"277\" y1=\"110\" y2=\"110\"></line><line stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-linecap=\"square\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" x1=\"267\" x2=\"277\" y1=\"200\" y2=\"200\"></line><text fill=\"#5C575E\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"10.5\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"start\" x=\"281\" y=\"158\">4,0 m</text><text fill=\"#2A5D9E\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"240\" y=\"50\">v₀</text></svg></span><div class=\"spel-en-del\">Vilken fart har bollen när den passerar balkongen på väg ned?</div>",
