    "kap": 3,
    "omr": "konstacc",
    "niva": "E",
    "typ": "kombinera stopptid stoppstracka och mellanliggande farter for ett bromsande tag, ur text, sokt tid stracka och fart",
    "poang": "(2/1/0)",
    "t": "<p>Ett tåg håller farten 30 m/s när föraren börjar bromsa. Tåget retarderar likformigt med 0,50 m/s² tills det står stilla.</p><span class=\"fig bred\"><svg height=\"137\" width=\"620\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" viewBox=\"0.000 20.840 470.000 103.529\"><line x1=\"14\" y1=\"110.5\" x2=\"456\" y2=\"110.5\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"20\" y1=\"111.5\" x2=\"20\" y2=\"117.5\" stroke=\"#5C575E\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"36\" y1=\"111.5\" x2=\"36\" y2=\"117.5\" stroke=\"#5C575E\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"52\" y1=\"111.5\" x2=\"52\" y2=\"117.5\" stroke=\"#5C575E\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"68\" y1=\"111.5\" x2=\"68\" y2=\"117.5\" stroke=\"#5C575E\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"84\" y1=\"111.5\" x2=\"84\" y2=\"117.5\" stroke=\"#5C575E\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"100\" y1=\"111.5\" x2=\"100\" y2=\"117.5\" stroke=\"#5C575E\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"116\" y1=\"111.5\" x2=\"116\" y2=\"117.5\" stroke=\"#5C575E\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"132\" y1=\"111.5\" x2=\"132\" y2=\"117.5\" stroke=\"#5C575E\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"148\" y1=\"111.5\" x2=\"148\" y2=\"117.5\" stroke=\"#5C575E\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"164\" y1=\"111.5\" x2=\"164\" y2=\"117.5\" stroke=\"#5C575E\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"180\" y1=\"111.5\" x2=\"180\" y2=\"117.5\" stroke=\"#5C575E\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"196\" y1=\"111.5\" x2=\"196\" y2=\"117.5\" stroke=\"#5C575E\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"212\" y1=\"111.5\" x2=\"212\" y2=\"117.5\" stroke=\"#5C575E\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"228\" y1=\"111.5\" x2=\"228\" y2=\"117.5\" stroke=\"#5C575E\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"244\" y1=\"111.5\" x2=\"244\" y2=\"117.5\" stroke=\"#5C575E\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"260\" y1=\"111.5\" x2=\"260\" y2=\"117.5\" stroke=\"#5C575E\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"276\" y1=\"111.5\" x2=\"276\" y2=\"117.5\" stroke=\"#5C575E\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"292\" y1=\"111.5\" x2=\"292\" y2=\"117.5\" stroke=\"#5C575E\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"308\" y1=\"111.5\" x2=\"308\" y2=\"117.5\" stroke=\"#5C575E\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"324\" y1=\"111.5\" x2=\"324\" y2=\"117.5\" stroke=\"#5C575E\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"340\" y1=\"111.5\" x2=\"340\" y2=\"117.5\" stroke=\"#5C575E\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"356\" y1=\"111.5\" x2=\"356\" y2=\"117.5\" stroke=\"#5C575E\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"372\" y1=\"111.5\" x2=\"372\" y2=\"117.5\" stroke=\"#5C575E\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"388\" y1=\"111.5\" x2=\"388\" y2=\"117.5\" stroke=\"#5C575E\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"404\" y1=\"111.5\" x2=\"404\" y2=\"117.5\" stroke=\"#5C575E\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"420\" y1=\"111.5\" x2=\"420\" y2=\"117.5\" stroke=\"#5C575E\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"436\" y1=\"111.5\" x2=\"436\" y2=\"117.5\" stroke=\"#5C575E\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"452\" y1=\"111.5\" x2=\"452\" y2=\"117.5\" stroke=\"#5C575E\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><path d=\"M 40 106 L 40 28.5 L 90 28.5 L 105 41 L 125 41 L 125 106 Z\" fill=\"#E8DCC6\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><rect x=\"132.5\" y=\"41\" width=\"72.5\" height=\"65\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"212.5\" y=\"41\" width=\"72.5\" height=\"65\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"60\" cy=\"106\" r=\"4.5\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"105\" cy=\"106\" r=\"4.5\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"147.5\" cy=\"106\" r=\"4.5\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"190\" cy=\"106\" r=\"4.5\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"227.5\" cy=\"106\" r=\"4.5\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"270\" cy=\"106\" r=\"4.5\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"310\" y1=\"76\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"76\" stroke=\"#2A5D9E\" stroke-width=\"2.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"400,76 390,80.6 390,71.4\" fill=\"#2A5D9E\"/><text x=\"355\" y=\"66\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#2A5D9E\">v₀ = 30 m/s</text><line x1=\"400\" y1=\"46\" x2=\"320\" y2=\"46\" stroke=\"#2A5D9E\" stroke-width=\"2.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"310,46 320,41.4 320,50.6\" fill=\"#2A5D9E\"/><text x=\"355\" y=\"38\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"10.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#2A5D9E\">bromsning 0,50 m/s²</text></svg></span>\n<ol><li>Hur lång tid tar inbromsningen?</li>\n<li>Hur lång är bromssträckan?</li>\n<li>Hur stor är farten när tåget har bromsat 400 meter?</li>\n<li>Hur långt har tåget kvar att rulla när farten har sjunkit till 10 m/s?</li></ol>",
    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2\"><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">a</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">Tåget bromsar från 30 m/s till vila med 0,50 m/s².</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[t=\\frac{30}{0{,}50}=60\\ \\mathrm s\\]</div></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">b</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">Beräkna bromssträckan.</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[s=\\frac{30^2}{2\\cdot0{,}50}=900\\ \\mathrm m\\]</div></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">c</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">Efter 400 m gäller sambandet utan tid.</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[v^2=30^2-2\\cdot0{,}50\\cdot400=500\\]\\[v=22{,}4\\ \\mathrm{m/s}\\]</div></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">d</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">När farten är 10 m/s återstår bromssträckan från 10 m/s till noll.</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[s_{\\mathrm{kvar}}=\\frac{10^2}{2\\cdot0{,}50}=100\\ \\mathrm m\\]</div></div></div><p class=\"facit-svar\"><strong>Svar:</strong> Inbromsningen tar \\(60\\ \\mathrm s\\) och \\(900\\ \\mathrm m\\). Efter 400 m är farten \\(22{,}4\\ \\mathrm{m/s}\\), och vid 10 m/s återstår \\(100\\ \\mathrm m\\).</p></div>",
