    "poang": "(2/0/0)",
    "t": "<div><p>Bestäm förflyttningen \\(\\Delta s\\) i intervallet \\(0 \\leq t \\leq 10\\) s för de rörelser som ges av \\(s\\)-\\(t\\)-diagrammen och \\(v\\)-\\(t\\)-diagrammen.</p>\n<p>H</p></div>\n<p><strong>a)</strong> <span class=\"fig\"><img src=\"../bilder_fysik1_import/blandade_diagram_i__image5.png\" style=\"display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto;margin:12px auto\"/></span></p>\n<p><strong>g)</strong> <span class=\"fig\"><img src=\"../bilder_fysik1_import/blandade_diagram_i__image6.png\" style=\"display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto;margin:12px auto\"/></span></p>\n<p><strong>m)</strong> <span class=\"fig\"><img src=\"../bilder_fysik1_import/blandade_diagram_i__image7.png\" style=\"display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto;margin:12px auto\"/></span></p>\n<p><strong>b)</strong> <span class=\"fig\"><img src=\"../bilder_fysik1_import/blandade_diagram_i__image8.png\" style=\"display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto;margin:12px auto\"/></span></p>\n<p><strong>h)</strong> <span class=\"fig\"><img src=\"../bilder_fysik1_import/blandade_diagram_i__image9.png\" style=\"display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto;margin:12px auto\"/></span></p>\n<p><strong>n)</strong> <span class=\"fig\"><img src=\"../bilder_fysik1_import/blandade_diagram_i__image10.png\" style=\"display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto;margin:12px auto\"/></span></p>\n<div>ch) <span class=\"fig\"><img src=\"../bilder_fysik1_import/blandade_diagram_i__image11.png\" style=\"display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto;margin:12px auto\"/></span> i) <span class=\"fig\"><img src=\"../bilder_fysik1_import/blandade_diagram_i__image12.png\" style=\"display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto;margin:12px auto\"/></span> o) <span class=\"fig\"><img src=\"../bilder_fysik1_import/blandade_diagram_i__image13.png\" style=\"display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto;margin:12px auto\"/></span></div>\n<p><strong>d)</strong> <span class=\"fig\"><img src=\"../bilder_fysik1_import/blandade_diagram_i__image14.png\" style=\"display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto;margin:12px auto\"/></span></p>\n<p><strong>j)</strong> <span class=\"fig\"><img src=\"../bilder_fysik1_import/blandade_diagram_i__image15.png\" style=\"display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto;margin:12px auto\"/></span></p>\n<p><strong>p)</strong> <span class=\"fig\"><img src=\"../bilder_fysik1_import/blandade_diagram_i__image16.png\" style=\"display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto;margin:12px auto\"/></span></p>\n<p><strong>e)</strong> <span class=\"fig\"><img src=\"../bilder_fysik1_import/blandade_diagram_i__image17.png\" style=\"display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto;margin:12px auto\"/></span></p>\n<p><strong>k)</strong> <span class=\"fig\"><img src=\"../bilder_fysik1_import/blandade_diagram_i__image18.png\" style=\"display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto;margin:12px auto\"/></span></p>\n<p><strong>q)</strong> <span class=\"fig\"><img src=\"../bilder_fysik1_import/blandade_diagram_i__image19.png\" style=\"display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto;margin:12px auto\"/></span></p>\n<p><strong>f)</strong> <span class=\"fig\"><img src=\"../bilder_fysik1_import/blandade_diagram_i__image20.png\" style=\"display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto;margin:12px auto\"/></span></p>\n<p><strong>l)</strong> <span class=\"fig\"><img src=\"../bilder_fysik1_import/blandade_diagram_i__image21.png\" style=\"display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto;margin:12px auto\"/></span></p>\n<p><strong>r)</strong> <span class=\"fig\"><img src=\"../bilder_fysik1_import/blandade_diagram_i__image22.png\" style=\"display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto;margin:12px auto\"/></span></p>",
    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2\"><div class=\"facit-del\"><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">Identifiera först vad axlarna visar. Lutningen och arean under grafen har olika fysikalisk betydelse beroende på diagramtyp.</p><p><strong>a)</strong> \\(\\Delta s = 4,0\\ m\\)</p>\n<p><strong>b)</strong> \\(\\Delta s = 40\\ m\\)</p>\n<p><strong>c)</strong> \\(\\Delta s = 7,0\\ m\\)</p>\n<p><strong>d)</strong> \\(\\Delta s = 60\\ m\\)</p>\n<p><strong>e)</strong> \\(\\Delta s = 8,0\\ m\\)</p>\n<p><strong>f)</strong> \\(\\Delta s = 25\\ m\\)</p>\n<p><strong>g)</strong> \\(\\Delta s = 64\\ m\\)</p>\n<p><strong>h)</strong> \\(\\Delta s = 5,0\\ m\\)</p>\n<p><strong>i)</strong> \\(\\Delta s = 48\\ m\\)</p>\n<p><strong>j)</strong> \\(\\Delta s = 0\\ m\\)</p>\n<p><strong>k)</strong> \\(\\Delta s = 45\\ m\\)</p>\n<p><strong>l)</strong> \\(\\Delta s = 1,0\\ m\\)</p>\n<p><strong>m)</strong> \\(\\Delta s = 55\\ m\\)</p>\n<p><strong>n)</strong> \\(\\Delta s = 6,0\\ m\\)</p>\n<p><strong>o)</strong> \\(\\Delta s = 55\\ m\\)</p>\n<p><strong>p)</strong> \\(\\Delta s = 69\\ m\\)</p>\n<p><strong>q)</strong> \\(\\Delta s = 2,0\\ m\\)</p>\n<p><strong>r)</strong> \\(\\Delta s = 30\\ m\\)</p></div></div></div>",
