        "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2\"><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">a</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">Använd fartlagen.</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[v=2{,}0+0{,}40\\cdot5{,}0=4{,}0\\ \\mathrm{m/s}\\]</div></div></div></div>",
