    "poang": "(2/0/0)",
    "t": "<p>På en kropp med massan 10 kg verkar två vinkelräta krafter enligt figuren.</p><span class=\"fig smal\"><svg height=\"261\" width=\"380\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" viewBox=\"129.143 13.735 238.286 163.675\"><rect x=\"140\" y=\"118\" width=\"80\" height=\"50\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#ECEFF3\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"180\" y=\"148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"10.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#2B2527\">10 kg</text><line x1=\"220\" y1=\"143\" x2=\"296\" y2=\"143\" stroke=\"#B43123\" stroke-width=\"2.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"306.00,143.00 296.00,147.60 296.00,138.40\" fill=\"#B43123\"/><text x=\"312\" y=\"139\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#B43123\">F₁ = 40 N</text><line x1=\"180\" y1=\"118\" x2=\"180\" y2=\"50\" stroke=\"#B43123\" stroke-width=\"2.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"180.00,40.00 184.60,50.00 175.40,50.00\" fill=\"#B43123\"/><text x=\"180\" y=\"30\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#B43123\">F₂ = 30 N</text></svg></span>\n<ol><li>Bestäm den resulterande kraftens storlek.</li>\n<li>Bestäm kroppens acceleration.</li></ol>",
    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2\"><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">a</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">De två krafterna är vinkelräta.</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[F_{\\mathrm{res}}=\\sqrt{40^2+30^2}=50\\ \\mathrm N\\]</div></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">b</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">Accelerationen får samma riktning som resultanten.</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[a=\\frac{50}{10}=5{,}0\\ \\mathrm{m/s^2}\\]</div></div></div><p class=\"facit-svar\"><strong>Svar:</strong> Resultanten är \\(50\\ \\mathrm N\\), och accelerationen är \\(5{,}0\\ \\mathrm{m/s^2}\\) i samma riktning.</p></div>",
