    "typ": "bestämma vid vilken vindkraft en skylt tippar med momentjämvikt kring tippkanten, ur diagram, sökt kraft och massa",
    "poang": "(1/2/0)",
    "t": "<p>En rollup-skylt utanför en butik är 1,8 m hög och väger 22 kg. Foten är 0,60 m bred och skyltens tyngdpunkt ligger mitt över foten. Vinden trycker på skylten med en kraft som kan räknas som om den angriper 1,2 m över marken.</p><span class=\"fig\"><svg height=\"276\" width=\"500\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" viewBox=\"21.029 17.105 422.543 232.895\"><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"205\" x2=\"424\" y2=\"205\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"50\" y1=\"205\" x2=\"42\" y2=\"214\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"72\" y1=\"205\" x2=\"64\" y2=\"214\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"94\" y1=\"205\" x2=\"86\" y2=\"214\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"116\" y1=\"205\" x2=\"108\" y2=\"214\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"138\" y1=\"205\" x2=\"130\" y2=\"214\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"160\" y1=\"205\" x2=\"152\" y2=\"214\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"182\" y1=\"205\" x2=\"174\" y2=\"214\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"204\" y1=\"205\" x2=\"196\" y2=\"214\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"226\" y1=\"205\" x2=\"218\" y2=\"214\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"248\" y1=\"205\" x2=\"240\" y2=\"214\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"270\" y1=\"205\" x2=\"262\" y2=\"214\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"292\" y1=\"205\" x2=\"284\" y2=\"214\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"314\" y1=\"205\" x2=\"306\" y2=\"214\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"336\" y1=\"205\" x2=\"328\" y2=\"214\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"358\" y1=\"205\" x2=\"350\" y2=\"214\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"380\" y1=\"205\" x2=\"372\" y2=\"214\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"402\" y1=\"205\" x2=\"394\" y2=\"214\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><rect x=\"190\" y=\"30\" width=\"80\" height=\"166\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"196\" y=\"196\" width=\"68\" height=\"9\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#E8DCC6\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"230\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#2B2527\">22 kg</text><circle cx=\"230\" cy=\"118\" r=\"3.5\" fill=\"#2B2527\" stroke=\"none\"/><line x1=\"230\" y1=\"124\" x2=\"230\" y2=\"169.5\" stroke=\"#B43123\" stroke-width=\"2.3\" stroke-linecap=\"butt\"/><polygon points=\"230,180 225.2,169.5 234.8,169.5\" fill=\"#B43123\"/><text x=\"246\" y=\"158\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#B43123\">F<tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\" font-size=\"9\">g</tspan></text><line x1=\"146\" y1=\"89\" x2=\"175.5\" y2=\"89\" stroke=\"#B43123\" stroke-width=\"2.3\" stroke-linecap=\"butt\"/><polygon points=\"186,89 175.5,93.8 175.5,84.2\" fill=\"#B43123\"/><text x=\"140\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#B43123\">F</text><text x=\"140\" y=\"104\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#5C575E\">vind</text><line x1=\"118\" y1=\"89\" x2=\"118\" y2=\"205\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"113\" y1=\"89\" x2=\"123\" y2=\"89\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"113\" y1=\"205\" x2=\"123\" y2=\"205\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><text x=\"110\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#5C575E\">1,2 m</text><line x1=\"196\" y1=\"228\" x2=\"264\" y2=\"228\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"196\" y1=\"223\" x2=\"196\" y2=\"233\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"264\" y1=\"223\" x2=\"264\" y2=\"233\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><text x=\"230\" y=\"244\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#5C575E\">0,60 m</text></svg></span>\n<ol><li>Kring vilken punkt tippar skylten? Rita in den.</li><li>Hur stort moment ger tyngdkraften kring den punkten?</li><li>Hur stor vindkraft krävs för att skylten ska välta?</li><li>Butiken vill att skylten ska klara 120 N. Hur mycket ballast måste läggas i foten?</li></ol>",
    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2\"><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">a</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">Skylten tippar kring fotens nedvindskant. Därifrån är det vågräta avståndet till tyngdpunkten 0,30 m.</p><p><span class=\"fig bred\"><svg height=\"263\" width=\"620\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" viewBox=\"22.114 15.925 315.771 134.075\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Skylt med markerad tippkant\"><line x1=\"35\" y1=\"124\" x2=\"325\" y2=\"124\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"145\" y=\"24\" width=\"70\" height=\"95\" fill=\"#EDEEF1\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"105\" y1=\"119\" x2=\"255\" y2=\"119\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"8\"/><circle cx=\"255\" cy=\"119\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#B43123\"/><text x=\"255\" y=\"143\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#B43123\">tippkant</text><line x1=\"180\" y1=\"64\" x2=\"180\" y2=\"105\" stroke=\"#2A5D9E\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><polygon points=\"180,115 175,104 185,104\" fill=\"#2A5D9E\"/><text x=\"190\" y=\"84\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#2A5D9E\">F<tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\" font-size=\"9\">g</tspan></text></svg></span></p></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">b</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">Tyngdkraftens stabiliserande moment kring tippkanten är</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[M_g=22\\cdot9{,}82\\cdot0{,}30=64{,}8\\ \\mathrm{Nm}\\]</div></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">c</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">Vid gränsen till vältning är vindens moment lika stort.</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[F_v\\cdot1{,}2=64{,}8\\Rightarrow F_v=54\\ \\mathrm N\\]</div></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">d</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">För att tåla 120 N krävs totalmassan</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[m_{\\mathrm{tot}}g\\cdot0{,}30=120\\cdot1{,}2\\]\\[m_{\\mathrm{tot}}=48{,}9\\ \\mathrm{kg}\\]\\[m_{\\mathrm{ballast}}=48{,}9-22=26{,}9\\ \\mathrm{kg}\\]</div></div></div><p class=\"facit-svar\"><strong>Svar:</strong> Skylten tippar kring nedvindskanten. Den välter vid cirka \\(54\\ \\mathrm N\\), och för att tåla 120 N behövs cirka \\(27\\ \\mathrm{kg}\\) ballast.</p></div>",
    "familj": "Tyngdpunkt och stabilitet",
    "formaga": [
      "procedur"
    ],
    "familjNyckel": "moment__tyngdpunkt_och_stabilitet",
