    "omr": "newton",
    "niva": "E",
    "poang": "(2/0/0)",
    "t": "<div>Skriv krafterna \\(F_{1}\\) och \\(F_{2}\\) som vektorer och beräkna sedan resultanten \\(F_{R}\\) till storlek och riktning. I figuren är 1 ruta lika med 1 N. Kontrollera med genom att rita in grafisk lösning.</div>\n<p><strong>a)</strong> <span class=\"fig\"><img src=\"../bilder_fysik1_import/krafter_som_vektorer_i__image1.png\" style=\"display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto;margin:12px auto\"/></span></p>\n<p><strong>b)</strong> <span class=\"fig\"><img src=\"../bilder_fysik1_import/krafter_som_vektorer_i__image2.png\" style=\"display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto;margin:12px auto\"/></span></p>\n<p><strong>c)</strong> <span class=\"fig\"><img src=\"../bilder_fysik1_import/krafter_som_vektorer_i__image3.png\" style=\"display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto;margin:12px auto\"/></span></p>\n<p><strong>d)</strong> <span class=\"fig\"><img src=\"../bilder_fysik1_import/krafter_som_vektorer_i__image4.png\" style=\"display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto;margin:12px auto\"/></span></p>\n<p><strong>e)</strong> <span class=\"fig\"><img src=\"../bilder_fysik1_import/krafter_som_vektorer_i__image5.png\" style=\"display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto;margin:12px auto\"/></span></p>\n<p><strong>f)</strong> <span class=\"fig\"><img src=\"../bilder_fysik1_import/krafter_som_vektorer_i__image6.png\" style=\"display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto;margin:12px auto\"/></span></p>\n<p><strong>g)</strong> <span class=\"fig\"><img src=\"../bilder_fysik1_import/krafter_som_vektorer_i__image7.png\" style=\"display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto;margin:12px auto\"/></span></p>\n<p><strong>h)</strong> <span class=\"fig\"><img src=\"../bilder_fysik1_import/krafter_som_vektorer_i__image8.png\" style=\"display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto;margin:12px auto\"/></span></p>",
    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2\"><div class=\"facit-del\"><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">Frilägg föremålet, välj positiv riktning och använd \\(\\sum F=ma\\). Var noga med kraftarnas riktningar.</p><p><strong>a)</strong> <p><span class=\"fig\"><img src=\"../bilder_fysik1_import/krafter_som_vektorer_i__image9.png\" style=\"display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto;margin:12px auto\"/></span></p>\n<p>\\(F_{R} = 7,2\\ N\\)</p>\n<p>\\(v = 34{^\\circ}\\)</p> b) <p><span class=\"fig\"><img src=\"../bilder_fysik1_import/krafter_som_vektorer_i__image10.png\" style=\"display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto;margin:12px auto\"/></span></p>\n<p>\\(F_{R} = 6,1\\ N\\)</p>\n<p>\\(v = 9,5{^\\circ}\\)</p></p>\n<p><strong>c)</strong> <p><span class=\"fig\"><img src=\"../bilder_fysik1_import/krafter_som_vektorer_i__image11.png\" style=\"display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto;margin:12px auto\"/></span></p>\n<p>\\(F_{R} = 0\\ N\\)</p>\n<p>Saknar riktning</p> d) <p><span class=\"fig\"><img src=\"../bilder_fysik1_import/krafter_som_vektorer_i__image12.png\" style=\"display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto;margin:12px auto\"/></span></p>\n<p>\\(F_{R} = 5,8\\ N\\)</p>\n<p>\\(v = 121{^\\circ}\\)</p></p>\n<p><strong>e)</strong> <p><span class=\"fig\"><img src=\"../bilder_fysik1_import/krafter_som_vektorer_i__image13.png\" style=\"display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto;margin:12px auto\"/></span></p>\n<p>\\(F_{R} = 2,0\\ N\\)</p>\n<p>\\(v = 270{^\\circ}\\)</p> f) <p><span class=\"fig\"><img src=\"../bilder_fysik1_import/krafter_som_vektorer_i__image14.png\" style=\"display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto;margin:12px auto\"/></span></p>\n<p>\\(F_{R} = 2,8\\ N\\)</p>\n<p>\\(v = 45{^\\circ}\\)</p></p>\n<p><strong>g)</strong> <p><span class=\"fig\"><img src=\"../bilder_fysik1_import/krafter_som_vektorer_i__image15.png\" style=\"display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto;margin:12px auto\"/></span></p>\n<p>\\(F_{R} = 3,0\\ N\\)</p>\n<p>\\(v = 90{^\\circ}\\)</p> h) <p><span class=\"fig\"><img src=\"../bilder_fysik1_import/krafter_som_vektorer_i__image16.png\" style=\"display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto;margin:12px auto\"/></span></p>\n<p>\\(F_{R} = 4,5\\ N\\)</p>\n<p>\\(v = 243{^\\circ}\\)</p></p></div></div></div>",
