    "niva": "C",
    "poang": "(1/2/0)",
    "t": "<p>En kloss med massan 0,12 kg dras framåt med konstant hastighet av en vågrät kraft på 0,32 N.</p><span class=\"fig bred\"><svg height=\"242\" width=\"620\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" viewBox=\"5.343 52.465 325.429 127.276\"><rect x=\"20\" y=\"92\" width=\"268\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#E8DCC6\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"34\" y=\"60\" width=\"78\" height=\"32\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#E8DCC6\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"73\" y=\"80\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#2B2527\">0,12 kg</text><line x1=\"112\" y1=\"76\" x2=\"282\" y2=\"76\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><circle cx=\"282\" cy=\"82\" r=\"14\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"282\" cy=\"82\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#2B2527\"/><line x1=\"296\" y1=\"82\" x2=\"296\" y2=\"142\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><rect x=\"276\" y=\"142\" width=\"40\" height=\"30\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#E8DCC6\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"296\" y=\"160\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#2B2527\">0,30 kg</text></svg></span><ol><li>Bestäm friktionstalet.</li><li>Vilken kraft krävs för konstant hastighet om en vikt på 0,30 kg läggs i klossen?</li></ol>",
    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2\"><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">a</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">Konstant hastighet ger \\(f=0{,}32\\ \\mathrm N\\).</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[\\mu=\\frac fN=\\frac{0{,}32}{0{,}12\\cdot9{,}82}=0{,}272\\]</div></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">b</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">Med den extra massan blir totalmassan 0,42 kg.</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[N_2=0{,}42\\cdot9{,}82=4{,}124\\ \\mathrm N\\]\\[F_2=\\mu N_2=0{,}272\\cdot4{,}124=1{,}12\\ \\mathrm N\\]</div></div></div><p class=\"facit-svar\"><strong>Svar:</strong> Friktionstalet är cirka \\(0{,}27\\), och den nya dragkraften blir cirka \\(1{,}12\\ \\mathrm N\\).</p></div>",
