"210\" y1=\"92\" x2=\"160\" y2=\"26\" stroke=\"#B43123\" stroke-width=\"2.64\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" marker-end=\"url(#situationspil-4-259)\"/><circle cx=\"210\" cy=\"92\" r=\"2.88\" fill=\"#B43123\"/><text x=\"134.56\" y=\"17.6\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"13.2\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#B43123\">S<tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\" font-size=\"9.6\">1</tspan></text><line x1=\"270\" y1=\"92\" x2=\"320\" y2=\"26\" stroke=\"#B43123\" stroke-width=\"2.64\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" marker-end=\"url(#situationspil-4-259)\"/><circle cx=\"270\" cy=\"92\" r=\"2.88\" fill=\"#B43123\"/><text x=\"329.6\" y=\"17.6\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"13.2\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#B43123\">S<tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\" font-size=\"9.6\">2</tspan></text><line x1=\"240\" y1=\"123\" x2=\"240\" y2=\"185\" stroke=\"#B43123\" stroke-width=\"2.64\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" marker-end=\"url(#situationspil-4-259)\"/><circle cx=\"240\" cy=\"123\" r=\"2.88\" fill=\"#B43123\"/><text x=\"248\" y=\"181\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"13.2\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#B43123\">F<tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\" font-size=\"9.6\">g</tspan></text></g></svg></span><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">a</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">Tre krafter verkar: tyngdkraften och två spännkrafter längs snörena.</p></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">b</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">Symmetrin ger lika stora spännkrafter.</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[S_1=S_2=S\\]</div></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">c</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">De vågräta komposanterna tar ut varandra. De lodräta bär tavlan.</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[2S\\sin\\theta=mg\\]</div><p>Eftersom \\(\\sin\\theta&lt;1\\) är summan \\(S_1+S_2\\) större än tyngdkraften när snörena lutar.</p></div></div><p class=\"facit-svar\"><strong>Svar:</strong> Spännkrafterna är lika stora. Det är deras lodräta komposanter, inte summan av beloppen, som tillsammans motsvarar tyngdkraften.</p></div>",
