    "id": "5.15",
    "kap": 5,
    "omr": "rorelsemangd",
    "niva": "C",
    "poang": "(1/2/0)",
    "t": "<p>Två vagnar rullar åt samma håll enligt figuren. Den bakre vagnen kör ikapp den främre, och när de kolliderar fastnar de i varandra.</p><span class=\"fig\"><svg height=\"305\" width=\"500\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" viewBox=\"0.000 5.659 335.029 204.341\"><text x=\"12\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#5C575E\">Före</text><rect x=\"50\" y=\"56\" width=\"76\" height=\"34\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"68.24\" cy=\"96\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><circle cx=\"68.24\" cy=\"96\" r=\"1.8\" fill=\"#2B2527\"/><circle cx=\"107.76\" cy=\"96\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><circle cx=\"107.76\" cy=\"96\" r=\"1.8\" fill=\"#2B2527\"/><text x=\"88\" y=\"77\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#2B2527\">2,5 kg</text><line x1=\"64\" y1=\"36\" x2=\"102\" y2=\"36\" stroke=\"#2A5D9E\" stroke-width=\"2.3\" stroke-linecap=\"butt\"/><polygon points=\"112,36 102,40.6 102,31.4\" fill=\"#2A5D9E\"/><text x=\"88\" y=\"24\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#2A5D9E\">4,0 m/s</text><rect x=\"244\" y=\"56\" width=\"76\" height=\"34\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"262.24\" cy=\"96\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><circle cx=\"262.24\" cy=\"96\" r=\"1.8\" fill=\"#2B2527\"/><circle cx=\"301.76\" cy=\"96\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><circle cx=\"301.76\" cy=\"96\" r=\"1.8\" fill=\"#2B2527\"/><text x=\"282\" y=\"77\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#2B2527\">4,0 kg</text><line x1=\"258\" y1=\"36\" x2=\"296\" y2=\"36\" stroke=\"#2A5D9E\" stroke-width=\"2.3\" stroke-linecap=\"butt\"/><polygon points=\"306,36 296,40.6 296,31.4\" fill=\"#2A5D9E\"/><text x=\"282\" y=\"24\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#2A5D9E\">1,8 m/s</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"178\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#5C575E\">Efter</text><rect x=\"122\" y=\"156\" width=\"76\" height=\"34\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"140.24\" cy=\"196\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><circle cx=\"140.24\" cy=\"196\" r=\"1.8\" fill=\"#2B2527\"/><circle cx=\"179.76\" cy=\"196\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><circle cx=\"179.76\" cy=\"196\" r=\"1.8\" fill=\"#2B2527\"/><text x=\"160\" y=\"177\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#2B2527\">2,5 kg</text><rect x=\"202\" y=\"156\" width=\"76\" height=\"34\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"220.24\" cy=\"196\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><circle cx=\"220.24\" cy=\"196\" r=\"1.8\" fill=\"#2B2527\"/><circle cx=\"259.76\" cy=\"196\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><circle cx=\"259.76\" cy=\"196\" r=\"1.8\" fill=\"#2B2527\"/><text x=\"240\" y=\"177\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#2B2527\">4,0 kg</text><line x1=\"216\" y1=\"136\" x2=\"254\" y2=\"136\" stroke=\"#2A5D9E\" stroke-width=\"2.3\" stroke-linecap=\"butt\"/><polygon points=\"264,136 254,140.6 254,131.4\" fill=\"#2A5D9E\"/><text x=\"240\" y=\"124\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#2A5D9E\">v = ?</text></svg></span>\n<p>Bestäm vagnarnas hastighet efter kollisionen.</p>",
    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2\"><p>Studera båda vagnarna som ett system. Under den korta stöten försummas yttre impuls i rörelseriktningen, så den totala rörelsemängden bevaras. När vagnarna fastnar får de samma sluthastighet. Rörelseenergin behöver däremot inte vara bevarad.</p><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">1</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">Båda vagnarna rör sig åt samma håll före stöten.</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[p_i=2{,}5\\cdot4{,}0+4{,}0\\cdot1{,}8=17{,}2\\ \\mathrm{kg\\,m/s}\\]</div></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">2</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">Efter stöten är den gemensamma massan 6,5 kg.</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[v=\\frac{17{,}2}{6{,}5}=2{,}65\\ \\mathrm{m/s}\\]</div></div></div><p class=\"facit-svar\"><strong>Svar:</strong> Den gemensamma farten är cirka \\(2{,}65\\ \\mathrm{m/s}\\) i ursprunglig riktning.</p></div>",
