    "niva": "C",
    "poang": "(0/2/1)",
    "t": "<p>En vagn kör in i en stillastående vagn enligt figuren.</p><span class=\"fig bred\"><svg height=\"355\" width=\"620\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" viewBox=\"0.000 5.659 356.400 204.341\"><text x=\"12\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#5C575E\">Före</text><rect x=\"60\" y=\"56\" width=\"76\" height=\"34\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"78.24\" cy=\"96\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><circle cx=\"78.24\" cy=\"96\" r=\"1.8\" fill=\"#2B2527\"/><circle cx=\"117.76\" cy=\"96\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><circle cx=\"117.76\" cy=\"96\" r=\"1.8\" fill=\"#2B2527\"/><text x=\"98\" y=\"77\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#2B2527\">10 kg</text><line x1=\"74\" y1=\"36\" x2=\"112\" y2=\"36\" stroke=\"#2A5D9E\" stroke-width=\"2.3\" stroke-linecap=\"butt\"/><polygon points=\"122,36 112,40.6 112,31.4\" fill=\"#2A5D9E\"/><text x=\"98\" y=\"24\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#2A5D9E\">2,5 m/s</text><rect x=\"264\" y=\"56\" width=\"76\" height=\"34\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"282.24\" cy=\"96\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><circle cx=\"282.24\" cy=\"96\" r=\"1.8\" fill=\"#2B2527\"/><circle cx=\"321.76\" cy=\"96\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><circle cx=\"321.76\" cy=\"96\" r=\"1.8\" fill=\"#2B2527\"/><text x=\"302\" y=\"77\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#2B2527\">5,0 kg</text><text x=\"302\" y=\"34\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#5C575E\">i vila</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"178\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#5C575E\">Efter</text><rect x=\"60\" y=\"156\" width=\"76\" height=\"34\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"78.24\" cy=\"196\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><circle cx=\"78.24\" cy=\"196\" r=\"1.8\" fill=\"#2B2527\"/><circle cx=\"117.76\" cy=\"196\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><circle cx=\"117.76\" cy=\"196\" r=\"1.8\" fill=\"#2B2527\"/><text x=\"98\" y=\"177\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#2B2527\">10 kg</text><line x1=\"74\" y1=\"136\" x2=\"112\" y2=\"136\" stroke=\"#2A5D9E\" stroke-width=\"2.3\" stroke-linecap=\"butt\"/><polygon points=\"122,136 112,140.6 112,131.4\" fill=\"#2A5D9E\"/><text x=\"98\" y=\"124\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#2A5D9E\">v = ?</text><rect x=\"264\" y=\"156\" width=\"76\" height=\"34\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"282.24\" cy=\"196\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><circle cx=\"282.24\" cy=\"196\" r=\"1.8\" fill=\"#2B2527\"/><circle cx=\"321.76\" cy=\"196\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><circle cx=\"321.76\" cy=\"196\" r=\"1.8\" fill=\"#2B2527\"/><text x=\"302\" y=\"177\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#2B2527\">5,0 kg</text><line x1=\"278\" y1=\"136\" x2=\"316\" y2=\"136\" stroke=\"#2A5D9E\" stroke-width=\"2.3\" stroke-linecap=\"butt\"/><polygon points=\"326,136 316,140.6 316,131.4\" fill=\"#2A5D9E\"/><text x=\"302\" y=\"124\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#2A5D9E\">3,2 m/s</text></svg></span>\n<ol><li>Vilken hastighet får den vänstra vagnen?</li>\n<li>Hur stor impuls fick den vänstra vagnen?</li>\n<li>Hur stor impuls fick den högra vagnen?</li></ol>",
    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2\"><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">a</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">Rörelsemängden bevaras.</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[10\\cdot2{,}5=10v+5{,}0\\cdot3{,}2\\Rightarrow v=0{,}90\\ \\mathrm{m/s}\\]</div></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">b</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">Vänstervagnens impuls är dess rörelsemängdsändring.</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[I_L=10(0{,}90-2{,}5)=-16\\ \\mathrm{Ns}\\]</div></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">c</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">Högervagnen startar från vila.</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[I_H=5{,}0\\cdot3{,}2=+16\\ \\mathrm{Ns}\\]</div><p>Impulserna är lika stora och motriktade.</p></div></div><p class=\"facit-svar\"><strong>Svar:</strong> Vänstervagnen får \\(0{,}90\\ \\mathrm{m/s}\\). Impulserna är \\(16\\ \\mathrm{Ns}\\) åt vänster respektive höger.</p></div>",
