    "t": "<p>Figuren visar två vagnar före och efter en kollision. Den vänstra vagnen väger 2,0 kg och den högra 4,0 kg. Vagnarna hakar i varandra vid stöten och rullar vidare tillsammans.</p><span class=\"fig\"><svg height=\"302\" width=\"500\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" viewBox=\"0.000 0.000 341.543 206.000\"><text x=\"12\" y=\"72\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#5C575E\">Före</text><rect x=\"60\" y=\"50\" width=\"76\" height=\"34\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"78\" cy=\"90\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><circle cx=\"78\" cy=\"90\" r=\"1.8\" fill=\"#2B2527\"/><circle cx=\"118\" cy=\"90\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><circle cx=\"118\" cy=\"90\" r=\"1.8\" fill=\"#2B2527\"/><line x1=\"74\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"112\" y2=\"30\" stroke=\"#2A5D9E\" stroke-width=\"2.3\"/><polygon points=\"122,30 112,34.6 112,25.4\" fill=\"#2A5D9E\"/><text x=\"98\" y=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#2A5D9E\">3,0 m/s</text><rect x=\"250\" y=\"50\" width=\"76\" height=\"34\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"268\" cy=\"90\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><circle cx=\"268\" cy=\"90\" r=\"1.8\" fill=\"#2B2527\"/><circle cx=\"308\" cy=\"90\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><circle cx=\"308\" cy=\"90\" r=\"1.8\" fill=\"#2B2527\"/><text x=\"288\" y=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#5C575E\">stilla</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"172\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#5C575E\">Efter</text><rect x=\"170\" y=\"150\" width=\"76\" height=\"34\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"188\" cy=\"190\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><circle cx=\"188\" cy=\"190\" r=\"1.8\" fill=\"#2B2527\"/><circle cx=\"228\" cy=\"190\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><circle cx=\"228\" cy=\"190\" r=\"1.8\" fill=\"#2B2527\"/><rect x=\"246\" y=\"150\" width=\"76\" height=\"34\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"264\" cy=\"190\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><circle cx=\"264\" cy=\"190\" r=\"1.8\" fill=\"#2B2527\"/><circle cx=\"304\" cy=\"190\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><circle cx=\"304\" cy=\"190\" r=\"1.8\" fill=\"#2B2527\"/><line x1=\"222\" y1=\"130\" x2=\"260\" y2=\"130\" stroke=\"#2A5D9E\" stroke-width=\"2.3\"/><polygon points=\"270,130 260,134.6 260,125.4\" fill=\"#2A5D9E\"/><text x=\"246\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#2A5D9E\">v = ?</text></svg></span>\n<ol><li>Hur stor är rörelsemängden före kollisionen?</li><li>Vilken fart får vagnarna efteråt?</li></ol>",
    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2\"><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">a</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">Den högra vagnen står stilla före stöten.</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[p_i=2{,}0\\cdot3{,}0=6{,}0\\ \\mathrm{kg\\,m/s}\\]</div></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">b</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">Efter stöten rör sig den sammanlagda massan 6,0 kg.</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[v=\\frac{6{,}0}{2{,}0+4{,}0}=1{,}0\\ \\mathrm{m/s}\\]</div></div></div><p class=\"facit-svar\"><strong>Svar:</strong> Rörelsemängden är \\(6{,}0\\ \\mathrm{kg\\,m/s}\\), och den gemensamma farten \\(1{,}0\\ \\mathrm{m/s}\\).</p></div>",
