    "t": "<p><strong>a)</strong> Bestäm potentialen i punkten <em>P</em>.</p>\n<p><span class=\"fig\"><img src=\"../bilder_fysik1_import/potentialvandring_ii__image1.png\" style=\"display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto;margin:12px auto\"/></span></p><p><strong>b)</strong> Bestäm potentialen i punkten <em>P</em>.</p>\n<p><span class=\"fig\"><img src=\"../bilder_fysik1_import/potentialvandring_ii__image2.png\" style=\"display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto;margin:12px auto\"/></span></p>",
