    "niva": "E",
    "poang": "(2/0/0)",
    "t": "<div>Fyll i det som saknas vid \\(X\\) vid följande kärnreaktioner (kärnklyvningar)</div>\n<p><strong>a)</strong> \\(_{0}^{1}n +_{92}^{235}U \\rightarrow_{56}^{141}{Ba} + X + 3_{0}^{\\ 1}n\\ \\)</p>\n<p><strong>b)</strong> \\(_{0}^{1}n +_{92}^{235}U \\rightarrow X +_{55}^{137}{Cs} + 3_{0}^{\\ 1}n\\ \\)</p>\n<p><strong>c)</strong> \\[_{0}^{1}n +_{92}^{235}U \\rightarrow X +_{61}^{151}{Pm} + 3_{0}^{\\ 1}n + 4\\ _{- 1}^{0}e\\]</p>\n<p><strong>d)</strong> \\(_{0}^{1}n + X \\rightarrow_{51}^{133}{Sb} +_{41}^{98}{Nb} + 3_{0}^{\\ 1}n\\ \\)</p>\n<p><strong>e)</strong> \\(_{0}^{1}n +_{92}^{235}U \\rightarrow_{52}^{137}{Tl} + X + 2_{0}^{\\ 1}n\\ \\)</p>\n<p><strong>f)</strong> \\(_{0}^{1}n +_{92}^{235}U \\rightarrow_{38}^{94}{Sr} +_{54}^{140}{Xe} + \\ \\ X_{0}^{\\ 1}n\\ \\)</p>\n<p><strong>g)</strong> \\[_{0}^{1}n + X \\rightarrow_{58}^{144}{Ce} +_{36}^{94}{Kr} + 2_{0}^{\\ 1}n\\]</p>\n<p><strong>h)</strong> \\[_{0}^{1}n +_{92}^{235}U \\rightarrow_{53}^{137}I +_{39}^{96}Y + X_{0}^{\\ 1}n\\]</p>",
    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2\"><div class=\"facit-del\"><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">Kontrollera först att både masstal och laddning bevaras. Frigjord energi fås från massdefekten med \\(E=\\Delta mc^2\\).</p><p><strong>a)</strong> \\[_{36}^{92}{Kr}\\]</p>\n<p><strong>b)</strong> \\[_{37}^{96}{Rb}\\]</p>\n<p><strong>c)</strong> \\[_{35}^{82}{Br}\\]</p>\n<p><strong>d)</strong> \\[_{92}^{233}U\\]</p>\n<p><strong>e)</strong> \\[_{40}^{97}{Zr}\\]</p>\n<p><strong>f)</strong> \\(2\\ \\)</p>\n<p><strong>g)</strong> \\[_{94}^{239}{Pu}\\]</p>\n<p><strong>h)</strong> \\[3\\]</p></div></div></div>",
