    "poang": "(1/2/0)",
    "t": "<p>Diagrammet visar massan som funktion av volymen för ett ämne.</p><span class=\"fig\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"470\" height=\"300\" viewBox=\"0 0 470 300\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Diagram\"><rect x=\"1\" y=\"1\" width=\"468\" height=\"298\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#E4E3E6\"/><g stroke=\"#E4E3E6\" stroke-width=\"1\"><line x1=\"55.0\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"55.0\" y2=\"258\"/><line x1=\"251.5\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"251.5\" y2=\"258\"/><line x1=\"448.0\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"448.0\" y2=\"258\"/><line x1=\"55\" y1=\"258.0\" x2=\"448\" y2=\"258.0\"/><line x1=\"55\" y1=\"140.0\" x2=\"448\" y2=\"140.0\"/><line x1=\"55\" y1=\"22.0\" x2=\"448\" y2=\"22.0\"/></g><line x1=\"55\" y1=\"258\" x2=\"448\" y2=\"258\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"55\" y1=\"258\" x2=\"55\" y2=\"22\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><g font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono,monospace\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#5C575E\"><text x=\"55.0\" y=\"284\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0</text><text x=\"251.5\" y=\"284\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0,5</text><text x=\"448.0\" y=\"284\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1,0</text><text x=\"47\" y=\"262.0\" text-anchor=\"end\">0</text><text x=\"47\" y=\"144.0\" text-anchor=\"end\">5</text><text x=\"47\" y=\"26.0\" text-anchor=\"end\">10</text></g><text x=\"454\" y=\"293\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\">V (10⁻³ m³)</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"17\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\">m (kg)</text><polyline points=\"55.0,258.0 448.0,45.6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#B43123\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span><ol><li>Bestäm ämnets densitet.</li><li>Hur stor volym har 75 g av ämnet?</li><li>Hur stor massa har 120 cm³ av ämnet?</li><li>Vilket vanligt metallämne ligger nära denna densitet?</li></ol>",
    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2\"><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">a</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">Lutningen \\(\\Delta m/\\Delta V\\) är densiteten.</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[\\rho=\\frac{9\\,\\mathrm{kg}}{1{,}0\\cdot10^{-3}\\,\\mathrm{m^3}}=9000\\,\\mathrm{kg/m^3}=9{,}0\\,\\mathrm{g/cm^3}\\]</div></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">b</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">Använd \\(V=m/\\rho\\).</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[V=\\frac{75}{9{,}0}=8{,}33\\,\\mathrm{cm^3}\\]</div></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">c</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">Använd \\(m=\\rho V\\).</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[m=9{,}0\\cdot120=1080\\,\\mathrm g=1{,}08\\,\\mathrm{kg}\\]</div></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">d</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">Koppar har densiteten cirka 8,96 g/cm³.</p><p>Ämnet kan därför vara koppar.</p></div></div></div>",
