    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">Volymen bestäms av massan och densiteten. Använd sedan \\(V=At\\).</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[V=\\frac{27{,}63}{19{,}3}=1{,}431\\,\\mathrm{cm^3}\\]</div><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[t=1{,}0\\,\\mu\\mathrm m=10^{-4}\\,\\mathrm{cm}\\]</div><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[A=\\frac{V}{t}=1{,}431\\cdot10^4\\,\\mathrm{cm^2}=1{,}43\\,\\mathrm{m^2}\\]</div><p class=\"facit-svar\"><strong>Svar:</strong> cirka \\(1{,}4\\ \\mathrm{m^2}\\)</p></div>",
